WEBVTT

00:12.932 --> 00:14.559
<i>Ten days have passed.</i>

00:15.143 --> 00:17.562
<i>I feel coming here was
the right decision.</i>

00:18.521 --> 00:23.109
<i>Lord Dias and I set up
a new nomadic tent together.</i>

00:23.735 --> 00:28.364
<i>The spear and armor he gave me
were also made from dragon materials.</i>

00:29.282 --> 00:32.493
<i>These are all rare items that not
even royalty could possess.</i>

00:33.119 --> 00:34.871
<i>Yet Lord Dias gave them to me.</i>

00:36.205 --> 00:38.291
<i>I must live up to those expectations.</i>

00:39.932 --> 00:45.897
<i>Let out an exhausted sigh,
the corner of my heart dyed in blue</i>

00:46.147 --> 00:48.315
<i>Brightening up this place</i>

00:48.316 --> 00:51.027
<i>Looking up at a proud self</i>

00:51.486 --> 00:53.987
<i>Amidst a world constantly turning upside down</i>

00:53.988 --> 00:56.657
<i>On the only path where I seemed to be lost</i>

00:56.658 --> 00:59.827
<i>I still stand firm on my own two feet</i>

01:01.996 --> 01:06.500
<i>Lamenting my lonely fate,
looking up at the distant sky</i>

01:06.501 --> 01:10.672
<i>Without a single reply
but we are still connected</i>

01:12.924 --> 01:15.051
<i>When will it end?</i>

01:15.635 --> 01:18.680
<i>The incompetent will eventually fall</i>

01:19.681 --> 01:23.643
<i>I wonder when this red color
will be completely eradicated</i>

01:25.019 --> 01:27.979
<i>Brushing everything aside,
soaring into the sky</i>

01:27.980 --> 01:32.526
<i>My heart is bright blue</i>

01:32.527 --> 01:33.694
<i>I can't fall anymore</i>

01:33.695 --> 01:39.324
<i>Let out an exhausted sigh,
the corner of my heart dyed in blue</i>

01:39.325 --> 01:44.538
<i>Raising my fist high,
determined to go to the very end</i>

01:44.539 --> 01:46.957
<i>Even if I'm knocked down by life a hundred times</i>

01:46.958 --> 01:49.668
<i>This blue color will still protect me</i>

01:49.669 --> 01:54.966
<i>Looking up at a proud self</i>

02:00.263 --> 02:03.014
<i>The endless song will echoes forever</i>

02:03.015 --> 02:05.852
<i>I am a proud blue color</i>

02:10.022 --> 02:12.400
Today we're having herb-roasted Black Bull meat.

02:12.734 --> 02:15.862
Klaus, this is really delicious.

02:19.282 --> 02:21.408
This is so good!

02:21.409 --> 02:24.036
I'm sure Alna will be
a wonderful wife in the future.

02:24.704 --> 02:26.164
Right, Lord Dias?

02:26.706 --> 02:28.040
Yeah...

02:32.128 --> 02:34.671
Have some more, Klaus.

02:34.672 --> 02:36.340
Thank you.

02:36.591 --> 02:38.217
You too, eat up, Lord Dias.

02:38.551 --> 02:43.514
By the way, being called "Lord" like this
still feels a bit strange to me.

02:44.599 --> 02:47.852
It's crucial to address you like this
to distinguish our status!

02:50.855 --> 02:55.358
"We contribute to the herd
by providing wool."

02:55.359 --> 02:58.946
"You must also become
someone useful," he said.

02:59.280 --> 03:01.657
I will do my best as a soldier
of this territory...

03:02.074 --> 03:04.243
so I don't let Francis down.

03:04.535 --> 03:08.413
<i>Right now, Klaus is
the only soldier here.</i>

03:08.414 --> 03:10.875
<i>But it's good that he's this energetic.</i>

03:13.961 --> 03:16.004
Is something coming again?

03:16.005 --> 03:17.130
Yeah.

03:17.131 --> 03:20.051
From the East, a group of 12.

03:20.718 --> 03:22.553
They are all humans.

03:26.015 --> 03:28.809
It seems among the 12 people...

03:28.810 --> 03:31.479
one of them is so weak they're about to die.

03:31.771 --> 03:33.898
I need to go check before it's too late.

03:34.273 --> 03:35.690
Should I come with you?

03:35.691 --> 03:37.859
No, you stay here.

03:37.860 --> 03:41.613
If there's any trouble over there,
I'll have Alna's group return.

03:41.614 --> 03:44.700
When that happens,
please protect everyone here.

03:45.326 --> 03:46.494
Leave it to me.

03:46.869 --> 03:47.870
I'm counting on you.

03:51.624 --> 03:53.668
<i>This magic is amazing.</i>

03:54.418 --> 03:56.587
<i>The East is where the Royal Capital is.</i>

03:57.421 --> 04:02.468
<i>Currently, in there resides the five Princes
and Princesses vying for the throne.</i>

04:03.010 --> 04:05.303
<i>The Third Princess Diane,
who came the other day...</i>

04:05.304 --> 04:08.348
<i>has less military influence
than the other factions...</i>

04:08.349 --> 04:11.060
<i>so she must have been trying
to recruit Lord Dias.</i>

04:11.561 --> 04:14.438
<i>The reward payment that
he never received...</i>

04:14.814 --> 04:18.359
<i>was likely embezzled by the Second Prince,
whose alleged greed is insatiable.</i>

04:19.110 --> 04:22.446
<i>The struggle for power
between nobles of various factions.</i>

04:22.864 --> 04:25.700
<i>Its shockwaves
have now reached even the frontier.</i>

04:31.289 --> 04:35.167
<i>Sooner or later,
war will reach this land.</i>

04:36.210 --> 04:40.005
<i>But if I can fight and die for Lord Dias...</i>

04:40.006 --> 04:41.382
<i>then it wouldn't be in vain.</i>

04:44.051 --> 04:46.053
How is he back so soon?

04:51.601 --> 04:53.018
Here is the medicine.

04:53.019 --> 04:54.437
Thank you.

04:55.021 --> 04:57.148
It will help relieve your fatigue.

05:02.028 --> 05:03.404
Thank you.

05:03.905 --> 05:05.822
Refugees?

05:05.823 --> 05:06.824
Yeah.

05:07.241 --> 05:09.410
There's a civil war
in the neighboring area.

05:09.827 --> 05:11.661
Their village was struggling due of it,

05:11.662 --> 05:14.415
so they chased out the old women
to have fewer mouths to feed.

05:15.041 --> 05:16.375
The neighboring area?

05:17.209 --> 05:19.462
That must be the Kasdeks territory.

05:20.338 --> 05:22.548
I passed by there on my way here.

05:23.215 --> 05:25.051
The situation is terrible.

05:25.551 --> 05:27.803
But it's quite impressive.

05:28.304 --> 05:31.723
That old woman Maya led everyone.

05:31.724 --> 05:35.144
I heard she used fortune-telling
to find a way to survive...

05:35.519 --> 05:37.647
and that's how they made it here.

05:38.272 --> 05:39.940
That's amazing, Klaus.

05:39.941 --> 05:41.024
Huh?

05:41.025 --> 05:44.445
Our territory's population
just increased by 12 people at once!

05:45.029 --> 05:47.573
<i>I knew he would say that.</i>

05:48.866 --> 05:51.076
We'll have to build more tents.

05:51.077 --> 05:52.953
L-Lord Dias.

05:52.954 --> 05:55.205
It's up to you
how you want to treat the refugees,

05:55.206 --> 05:57.499
but they won't be very productive...

05:57.500 --> 05:59.960
That's exactly what makes them great.

05:59.961 --> 06:02.504
They are all over 70 years old.

06:02.505 --> 06:05.507
Maya herself is already 90.

06:05.508 --> 06:08.427
It would be great to learn from their life experiences.

06:08.761 --> 06:10.262
He's not even listening.

06:10.680 --> 06:12.306
I agree with him.

06:13.140 --> 06:15.518
Dias is the lord here, after all.

06:18.813 --> 06:22.524
Francis and François also said they'll follow
the strongest in the herd,

06:22.525 --> 06:24.067
which is Dias.

06:24.068 --> 06:27.071
We need to hurry
and build residences for the old women.

06:30.449 --> 06:33.869
<i>That's right, that's just the kind of person he is.</i>

06:38.207 --> 06:40.418
It's regrettable, but we have to retreat.

06:41.293 --> 06:43.503
Retreating without a fight?

06:43.504 --> 06:46.297
The enemy forces are almost upon us.

06:46.298 --> 06:49.677
Who will protect the people
in the evacuation area?

06:50.011 --> 06:52.096
Shut up! Let's go!

06:52.888 --> 06:53.931
You guys...

06:54.473 --> 06:56.726
And you call yourselves
the kingdom's soldiers?

07:00.062 --> 07:01.521
<i>The enemy is here...</i>

07:01.522 --> 07:02.605
<i>Damn it.</i>

07:02.606 --> 07:04.941
<i>Am I going to die here?</i>

07:04.942 --> 07:07.861
Hey, Klaus!

07:07.862 --> 07:09.237
Dias!?

07:09.238 --> 07:10.822
Where have you been all this time?

07:10.823 --> 07:14.451
I heard a child crying,
so I went to check it out.

07:14.452 --> 07:15.911
As you can see.

07:18.581 --> 07:20.999
Sorry, please let this kid in as well.

07:21.000 --> 07:22.792
Don't leave me behind!

07:22.793 --> 07:24.419
I'm so scared.

07:24.420 --> 07:25.963
Please don't go.

07:26.922 --> 07:28.883
I'm not going anywhere.

07:29.216 --> 07:32.845
I will definitely protect you,
just wait a little longer, okay?

07:40.061 --> 07:41.062
Klaus.

07:42.271 --> 07:43.647
Don't die.

07:45.316 --> 07:46.317
Yes!

07:50.488 --> 07:53.157
<i>After that, I don't remember clearly.</i>

07:53.783 --> 07:57.995
<i>The only thing on my mind was
not letting the enemy near the shelter...</i>

08:00.706 --> 08:03.209
<i>and supporting him at all costs.</i>

08:03.542 --> 08:07.463
<i>I believed that was the best way to fight
in that situation.</i>

08:22.645 --> 08:25.439
<i>Since that day, this person
hasn't changed at all.</i>

08:26.565 --> 08:28.400
<i>Even after becoming a lord.</i>

08:29.443 --> 08:30.986
<i>I really am a fool.</i>

08:31.654 --> 08:34.156
<i>To even think about dying a heroic death.</i>

08:35.282 --> 08:37.701
<i>I should live so that I can be of help.</i>

08:38.202 --> 08:41.789
<i>Help this man who is trying to become
a wonderful lord.</i>

08:43.332 --> 08:47.085
Wait, you're going to break the tent.

08:47.086 --> 08:48.963
Let me help you.

08:51.090 --> 08:56.094
THE FRONTIER LORD AND THE PECULIAR MERCHANT

08:56.095 --> 08:58.429
CURRENT STATUS
REPORT OF NETZROS TERRITORY FACILITIES:

08:58.430 --> 09:00.598
NOMADIC TENTS FOR LIVING: FIVE
GATHERING PLACE: ONE / STOREHOUSES: TWO

09:00.599 --> 09:02.100
SQUARE, MEAR BARN,
TOILET, WELL

09:02.101 --> 09:06.271
Thank you for building
a gathering place for us.

09:06.272 --> 09:10.525
We will use this place
as our workshop from now on.

09:10.526 --> 09:15.697
They said when we've collected enough Mear wool,
they'll help us spin yarn and weave fabric.

09:15.698 --> 09:17.575
That would be great.

09:20.703 --> 09:23.788
Why do you look so pensive?

09:23.789 --> 09:24.789
Well...

09:24.790 --> 09:29.211
Our population has grown, so I was thinking
of declaring this place as a village.

09:29.587 --> 09:31.546
But I haven't thought of a good name.

09:31.547 --> 09:33.965
Just name it Dias Village.

09:33.966 --> 09:36.010
We can't use my name.

09:36.468 --> 09:39.596
I think the name "Dragon Slayer Village"
sounds better!

09:39.597 --> 09:40.763
I refuse.

09:40.764 --> 09:41.724
Huh?

09:42.183 --> 09:44.809
How about Ilk Village?

09:44.810 --> 09:46.144
Ilk Village?

09:46.145 --> 09:49.772
In the ancient language, it means
"the first village."

09:49.773 --> 09:51.233
Easy to understand, right?

09:51.650 --> 09:52.818
Ilk...

09:53.235 --> 09:54.778
Ilk Village?

10:02.036 --> 10:04.205
Yeah, let's go with that.

10:05.456 --> 10:07.041
Alright, dismissed.

10:07.458 --> 10:09.417
That name sound nice.

10:09.418 --> 10:11.169
It really does.

10:11.170 --> 10:13.796
Dias, now we have a village.

10:13.797 --> 10:15.799
Next, we have to raise the population.

10:16.217 --> 10:17.425
Yeah.

10:17.426 --> 10:20.845
<i>But Maya's suggestion earlier...</i>

10:20.846 --> 10:23.307
Did you call me, Dias?

10:24.099 --> 10:26.518
I had a feeling you were calling me.

10:27.061 --> 10:29.396
<i>No, I didn't say anything.</i>

10:29.855 --> 10:33.692
Let us proceed with our chat
from earlier then.

10:34.109 --> 10:38.029
If you want to increase the population,
you can sell the dragon materials...

10:38.030 --> 10:39.948
and buy slaves.

10:39.949 --> 10:41.784
Why don't you do that?

10:43.118 --> 10:45.287
I hate slavery.

10:46.247 --> 10:49.041
I've encountered many slaves
who fought in the war.

10:49.625 --> 10:52.002
They were all treated very badly.

10:52.878 --> 10:54.545
In my domain...

10:54.546 --> 10:58.467
I will prohibit both the ownership
and the trading of slaves.

11:02.721 --> 11:04.264
Thank goodness.

11:04.265 --> 11:07.058
We also hate slaves very much.

11:07.059 --> 11:08.102
Huh!?

11:08.477 --> 11:09.894
Then why...

11:09.895 --> 11:12.230
I just wanted to know
your true thoughts.

11:12.231 --> 11:16.610
If you had intended to buy slaves,
I would have found a way to stop you.

11:17.194 --> 11:18.820
I'm sorry.

11:18.821 --> 11:23.200
In our old territory,
that was all we ever saw.

11:23.951 --> 11:25.995
The Kasdeks territory?

11:28.080 --> 11:31.792
The lord and his eldest son there
enjoyed hunting slaves.

11:32.251 --> 11:35.378
As for the second son who started
a war against them...

11:35.379 --> 11:39.383
I heard he also keeps a bunch of
female slaves by his side.

11:39.842 --> 11:43.553
But it won't be like that here in Ilk Village.

11:43.554 --> 11:45.306
I won't let that happen.

11:52.938 --> 11:56.149
I asked the merchants
who frequent the demon tribe's village...

11:56.150 --> 11:59.486
to drop by here since it's on their way.

12:00.154 --> 12:02.239
I wonder what kind of people they are?

12:10.456 --> 12:12.458
<i>A frog!?</i>

12:14.084 --> 12:15.294
Ribbit.

12:16.003 --> 12:19.505
Are you the dragon slayer
from the rumors?

12:19.506 --> 12:22.842
My name is Peijin Do.

12:22.843 --> 12:26.012
I hope we can have
a good business partnership.

12:26.013 --> 12:28.431
He belongs to the Frogman race.

12:28.432 --> 12:30.476
<i>A frog person!</i>

12:31.018 --> 12:35.898
First, could you show me the materials
from the Earth Dragon?

12:37.316 --> 12:40.027
<i>White...
He has no hostile intentions.</i>

12:40.569 --> 12:42.071
Here it is.

12:43.614 --> 12:45.198
Is there a problem?

12:45.199 --> 12:46.866
Oh, no.

12:46.867 --> 12:49.369
I thought it would just be a juvenile.

12:49.370 --> 12:51.789
Pardon my rudeness, but may I ask?

12:52.164 --> 12:54.416
Did you really take it down all by yourself?

12:57.252 --> 13:01.507
<i>He want to confirm
if his business partner is lying, huh?</i>

13:10.015 --> 13:13.519
Here is
the Dragon Scale Cleaving Battle Axe!

13:15.020 --> 13:17.230
Is this enough for you to believe me?

13:17.231 --> 13:19.816
Of course.

13:19.817 --> 13:22.026
I will purchase all of it!

13:22.027 --> 13:24.654
You guys, hurry up and unload the goods.

13:24.655 --> 13:26.156
Y-Yes, sir!

13:27.616 --> 13:31.161
Thank goodness, it looks like
I can still afford to pay.

13:31.453 --> 13:34.623
Oh right, by the way,
take a look at this too.

13:35.791 --> 13:38.000
They can't be sold
in the beastmen's land...

13:38.001 --> 13:42.047
but Mr. Dias is human,
so I believe you will buy them.

13:48.846 --> 13:51.140
<i>Their eyes have lost all their light.</i>

13:51.515 --> 13:53.767
<i>They must be orphans like me.</i>

13:54.560 --> 13:57.395
<i>Is Peijin selling orphans...</i>

13:57.396 --> 13:58.856
<i>as slaves?</i>

14:00.691 --> 14:01.942
Calm down.

14:02.401 --> 14:03.609
Alna.

14:03.610 --> 14:08.782
Don't make such a scary face
in front of the children, Dias.

14:09.491 --> 14:11.242
I apologize...

14:11.243 --> 14:14.328
but we do not wish to purchase slaves.

14:14.329 --> 14:16.289
N-No, that's not it.

14:16.290 --> 14:18.124
These two are not slaves.

14:18.125 --> 14:21.837
If I hadn't turned them into merchandise,
they would've been dead long ago!

14:22.796 --> 14:24.964
In the village where they were born...

14:24.965 --> 14:28.801
the residents hate twins,
believing they bring misfortune.

14:28.802 --> 14:32.346
As soon as they were born,
they were sentenced to be executed.

14:32.347 --> 14:35.851
Their parents took them and fled the village.

14:36.143 --> 14:38.644
I've known them since then.

14:38.645 --> 14:44.151
Their parents also fell ill after
overworking themselves too much.

14:45.152 --> 14:47.987
Knowing they didn't have much time left to live...

14:47.988 --> 14:50.699
they entrusted these two children to me.

14:51.200 --> 14:55.245
At first I refused because I didn't want to do
unprofitable charity work.

14:55.704 --> 14:58.289
But they even offered money...

14:58.290 --> 15:01.667
and asked me to take them in as merchandise.

15:01.668 --> 15:04.046
So I couldn't bear to refuse.

15:10.594 --> 15:13.679
Now that money has also been spent,
I'm only making losses!

15:13.680 --> 15:17.601
I really have no bad intentions,
please forgive me.

15:19.019 --> 15:20.437
He is not lying.

15:21.313 --> 15:22.314
Besides...

15:22.773 --> 15:24.816
they possess a very strong blue color.

15:26.652 --> 15:27.736
Understood.

15:28.237 --> 15:30.404
I will adopt these two children.

15:30.405 --> 15:33.950
All the expenses for their upbringing up to now,
I will pay with materials.

15:33.951 --> 15:36.161
Thank goodness! That's wonderful!

15:53.887 --> 15:56.223
You two are about
three or four years old, right?

15:56.640 --> 15:58.516
You're both so thin.

15:58.517 --> 16:00.769
From now on, you must eat properly, okay?

16:01.311 --> 16:03.438
My name is Dias.

16:03.814 --> 16:06.441
Can you tell me your names?

16:09.236 --> 16:12.489
What do you guys like to play?
Let's play together.

16:12.864 --> 16:16.076
Tell me what your favorite foods are,
and I'll get them for you.

16:16.994 --> 16:19.454
By the way, what are your names?

16:21.957 --> 16:24.710
<i>Although this method
isn't great, his intent is good...</i>

16:25.711 --> 16:28.504
What is it, so you don't have names?

16:28.505 --> 16:31.216
Then let me give you names!

16:31.883 --> 16:34.928
Let's see, what should I name you...

16:36.513 --> 16:37.638
No!

16:37.639 --> 16:39.057
We don't need them!

16:39.891 --> 16:42.727
Then tell me your names.

16:42.728 --> 16:44.646
I don't know what to call you.

16:46.690 --> 16:48.108
Senai.

16:49.026 --> 16:50.277
Ayhan.

16:51.570 --> 16:54.947
I see, Senai and Ayhan?

16:54.948 --> 16:56.949
Thank you for telling me.

16:56.950 --> 17:00.037
You both have very lovely names.

17:00.329 --> 17:02.080
Alright, Senai, Ayhan.

17:02.372 --> 17:05.625
Go take a bath with sister Alna over there...

17:05.626 --> 17:08.503
and then change your clothes, okay?

17:13.800 --> 17:15.510
Now, come here with me.

17:15.802 --> 17:19.598
Later, I'll give you both
some steamed potatoes, okay?

17:20.515 --> 17:22.976
I can't believe you managed
to get their names.

17:23.393 --> 17:28.732
They are trying to protect the precious names
given to them by their beloved parents.

17:29.566 --> 17:30.817
It's truly amazing.

17:31.151 --> 17:34.528
You are very good at connecting
with children.

17:34.529 --> 17:38.784
Before the war, I used to take care
of other orphans like a father.

17:39.618 --> 17:42.663
I hope they are still safe now.

17:45.082 --> 17:46.583
We're finally done.

17:47.042 --> 17:48.460
Thank you for your hard work.

17:50.921 --> 17:53.882
Oh, you look so much cleaner now.

17:56.051 --> 17:58.844
<i>They can't just open up
their hearts right away.</i>

17:58.845 --> 18:01.473
<i>For now, knowing their names is enough.</i>

18:02.057 --> 18:05.185
It suits you both very well, Senai, Ayhan.

18:07.562 --> 18:10.273
<i>They're not from the human race, are they.</i>

18:10.607 --> 18:14.194
<i>But I can feel
a blessing coming from them.</i>

18:14.611 --> 18:17.239
<i>I'll just observe them for a while longer.</i>

18:19.783 --> 18:21.618
This one is for Senai.

18:24.788 --> 18:26.373
And this one is for Ayhan.

18:29.501 --> 18:30.668
Senai.

18:30.669 --> 18:33.337
In the ancient language, your name means...

18:33.338 --> 18:35.465
someone as beautiful as the moonlight.

18:36.216 --> 18:37.425
Ayhan.

18:37.426 --> 18:40.554
Your name means
the sacred moon.

18:41.012 --> 18:46.226
Your parents must have had
a deep attachment for it.

18:46.977 --> 18:51.189
So I'm giving you two
this gemstone called "Love".

18:51.982 --> 18:54.860
It is said that they carry
with them lunar power.

18:55.986 --> 18:58.155
Someone as beautiful as the moonlight...

18:58.613 --> 19:00.574
The sacred moon...

19:01.074 --> 19:03.325
Senai, Ayhan.

19:03.326 --> 19:04.828
I love you.

19:05.787 --> 19:09.666
Dad always prays for your happiness.

19:13.545 --> 19:18.592
You two have tried so hard having to
leave your beloved parents.

19:18.884 --> 19:21.677
But you don't have to
endure it anymore.

19:21.678 --> 19:24.097
If you want to cry, just cry.

19:27.559 --> 19:30.061
It seems they also want to comfort them.

19:30.437 --> 19:33.231
They said they are good
at coaxing children.

19:40.030 --> 19:43.073
Alna, what is the ancient language?

19:43.074 --> 19:46.452
The ancient language only exists in
orally transmitted stories...

19:46.453 --> 19:48.288
no one uses it anymore.

19:48.622 --> 19:52.918
I also don't know if it's
only passed down within the demon tribe.

19:53.418 --> 19:56.213
But those two don't seem
to be from the human race.

19:56.546 --> 19:59.966
Perhaps they are a race that knew
the demon tribe in the past.

20:07.307 --> 20:12.604
<i>Since that day, Ilk Village has become
a lot more active and busier.</i>

20:14.481 --> 20:16.691
<i>And ten days have passed since then.</i>

20:17.150 --> 20:20.694
Ah, Senai ate Ayhan's potato!

20:20.695 --> 20:22.696
I already apologized.

20:22.697 --> 20:25.241
I was planning to save it for last.

20:25.242 --> 20:27.159
Let me share my portion with you.

20:27.160 --> 20:29.329
I'm not eating the left over from Dias.

20:33.583 --> 20:35.252
It seems someone else is coming.

20:35.961 --> 20:39.631
A horse rider coming from the East.

20:40.048 --> 20:42.384
I'll go check it out first.

20:44.845 --> 20:47.096
Even though they don't want to leave Dias,

20:47.097 --> 20:50.099
they prefer to be
with Senai and Ayhan right now.

20:50.100 --> 20:52.519
Is that so, take care of them for me.

20:54.980 --> 20:56.856
Come back early.

20:56.857 --> 20:58.108
We'll be waiting.

20:58.817 --> 21:01.444
Yeah, I'll be right back.

21:05.031 --> 21:06.241
He's here.

21:07.909 --> 21:10.453
He is white, no hostile intentions.

21:12.914 --> 21:16.667
Are you Lord Dias?

21:16.668 --> 21:19.920
Yes, I am. And who are you?

21:19.921 --> 21:21.505
Pardon my manners.

21:21.506 --> 21:23.507
I am Camarotz.

21:23.508 --> 21:29.346
A servant of Lord Eldan Kasdeks,
the new lord of the Kasdeks territory.

21:29.347 --> 21:31.223
<i>Of the Kasdeks territory?</i>

21:31.224 --> 21:35.269
Lord Eldan wishes to meet with Lord Dias.

21:35.270 --> 21:37.563
He is currently also
on his way here.

21:37.564 --> 21:40.232
We await visiting your mansion
for a meeting...

21:40.233 --> 21:41.318
Let's just meet here.

21:44.279 --> 21:46.698
Y-Yes, I understand.

21:48.783 --> 21:50.409
<i>The new lord...</i>

21:50.410 --> 21:53.622
<i>So that means the second son won
in the civil war?</i>

21:54.414 --> 21:57.833
<i>A person who keeps
a bunch of female slaves like him</i>

21:57.834 --> 21:59.961
<i>cannot be allowed near Ilk Village.</i>

22:02.839 --> 22:05.634
What is that thing!?

22:10.722 --> 22:15.143
<i>Our hands tightly intertwined
along with our dreams</i>

22:15.518 --> 22:19.605
<i>The future we draw together</i>

22:19.606 --> 22:23.610
<i>Is always waiting there</i>

22:31.493 --> 22:36.246
<i>I don't know why
it's still that familiar path</i>

22:36.247 --> 22:41.044
<i>But there are days when my heart
suddenly feels heavy and wants to give up</i>

22:41.294 --> 22:45.798
<i>Tears fall, then a smile blooms</i>

22:45.799 --> 22:51.054
<i>Everyone in life has stepped through
days like that</i>

22:51.596 --> 22:56.308
<i>No matter what form
the dawn greets us in</i>

22:56.309 --> 23:00.562
<i>The promise made under the meteor shower</i>

23:00.563 --> 23:03.357
<i>Will never fade</i>

23:03.358 --> 23:07.987
<i>Nor can it be tarnished</i>

23:07.988 --> 23:09.446
<i>Please believe me</i>

23:09.447 --> 23:14.159
<i>Our hands tightly intertwined
along with our dreams</i>

23:14.160 --> 23:18.956
<i>Even if one day we accidentally lose each other</i>

23:18.957 --> 23:23.544
<i>We will definitely meet again under that sky</i>

23:23.545 --> 23:29.384
<i>It is a certainty</i>

23:29.884 --> 23:34.389
<i>So keep smiling</i>
